{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"EX大衆発売日でした！ みなさん見てくれましたかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！81回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nゆうだーいさんからいただきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/15/5318413/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この間、お仕事がいつもより早めに終わったので、お父さんと二人で\n渋谷のロフト二階に期間限定で\nOPENしているカフェにいきました！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろ食べましたが、\n里芋味噌マヨネーズグラタンが\n一番美味しかった～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また16日から違うメニューになるので\n食べに行きたいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/15/5318413/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/03/15/5318413/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(1)  心矢さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎な～～～に～～～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(175)  健吾さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃんこんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんと未央奈の関係素敵だね^ ^"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎そういってもらえて嬉しいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未央奈とは言葉にできない関係です！\n言葉にすれば簡単ですが\nそんな簡単には表現できない！\n大切！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(200)  チョモランマさん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎きいちゃん、あなたはホントにダイエットする気あるんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎ありますよ。毎日、ダイエットのこと考えてますよ。\n考えない日なんてないですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな今日も起きた瞬間から\n思いましたよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、今日もアイス２つ食べて\n甘いものもたくさん食べましたよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな感じなんでよ。毎日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダイエットするきっかけが欲しいって思いますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶対に絶対にダイエットしなくちゃ\nいけない環境と理由が欲しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"( ¯•ω•¯ )！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"■(450)  あしゅみな最高さん■"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"⬅︎和食、洋食、中華の中でどれ1番好き？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"➡︎和食も洋食も中華もだいすきだから、\n選べない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"